# LEGACY REFERENCE — Phase 10 (Single Source of Truth Config)
#
# As of Phase 10, Aura no longer requires a .env file. All secrets
# (Telegram token, LLM API key, etc.) are stored in data/aura.db and
# configured through the first-run setup wizard at http://127.0.0.1:18080.
#
# This file is kept for operators upgrading from a pre-Phase-10 install.
# On the first boot after upgrading, Aura automatically imports any secrets
# found in data/.env into aura.db (idempotent, runs once, then becomes a no-op).
# After the migration you can safely delete data/.env.
#
# See INSTALL.md for the current first-run flow.
